{"type": "tool", "tool": "write", "callID": "chatcmpl-tool-8374fec9d37bc049", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"content": "// Testbench: Bug-07 — Key Manager Source Key Valid Signal Ignored
// Target: keymgr_input_checks.sv:80-99
